  "content": "<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入我們的Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\"></a></h1>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n\n# **夜視**\n\n洞穴視覺是一個輕量級的 Minecraft 資料包，能讓所有玩家獲得**無限夜視**效果，非常適合探索黑暗洞穴和建築，無需火把。\n\n---\n\n## 特色\n- 自動賦予所有玩家**夜視**效果。\n- 效果靜態施放（無旋轉粒子）。\n- 完全相容 **Minecraft 1.20.5+**。\n- 即插即用，無需任何設定。\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1294716/description_e7199d76-06d1-4492-aeab-06156c309240.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1294716/description_b57d75be-5f97-45fe-8598-81a6537e7099.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
